sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Web
    participant API
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Worker
    User->>Web: Restore item from trash
    Web->>API: Item ID and deletion marker
    API->>DB: Lock preview resource, then board
    API->>DB: Check permission and deletion marker
    API->>DB: Restore item and commit item.restored
    API-->>Web: Current item
    Web->>Web: Refresh affected views
    Worker->>DB: Consume restoration event
    Worker->>Worker: Resume eligible media processing
